<title>PERU: Peru's Edelnor 11-month net falls.</title>
<headline>Peru's Edelnor 11-month net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended November 11.</p>
<p>Share n.a.</p>
<p>Net 90.8 million soles vs 94.7 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs 637.0 million soles vs 568.5 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Empresa de Distribucion Electrica de Lima Norte SA, which was privatized in July 1994, is one of Peru's largest electricity distributors. It is owned by the Distrilima consortium consisting of Chilean companies Enersis and Distribuidora Chilectra and Spain's Endesa.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima Newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
